{
  "locale": "zh-Hant",
  "$comment": [
    "Glossary for L-13 (doc 06 §3.7, §4.3; doc 08 §7.2.1–§7.2.4; R64, I18-07). zh-Hant copy is not written yet (T1, publish:false); this file is ready for it.",
    "required: app names from tables T-A/T-B with fixes X1 (更多释义 → 更多釋義) and X13 (one name: 右滑翻譯). Other kickers are added when the zh-Hant copy is finalized.",
    "mainlandTerms: doc 08 §7.2.4 (58 groups; 搜索引擎 is covered by 搜索; R64 requires ≥ 40). Body copy uses Taiwan usage; quoting an app button name follows the app (rule ④) — list those keys in allowInKeys. Context-dependent pairs use lookarounds: 雙擊 stays in the feature name 雙擊查詞, 本地引擎 / 本地朗讀 may be quoted as the app's name in 「」.",
    "U+30FB ・ is rejected by the validator itself for zh-Hant (I18-07)."
  ],
  "required": {
    "features[swipe].kicker": "右滑翻譯",
    "features[lookup].kicker": "雙擊查詞",
    "demo.ui.more": "更多釋義",
    "pricing.table.rows.more": "更多釋義",
    "pricing.table.rows.chunks": "語言塊提取",
    "pricing.table.rows.actionFlow": "句子動作脈絡"
  },
